# Module

## Deployment Infrastructure: Art MD Website

**Platform:** Terraform

**Provider:** AWS

**State:**

- Backend — `$OPS/backend/main.tf` (S3 `noodlestan-tf-backend` + DynamoDB `noodlestan-tf-lock`, `eu-west-1`)
- Root — `$OPS/domains/noodlestan/main.tf`

**Files:**

- `$OPS/domains/noodlestan/websites/art-md/main.tf` — the `art_md_web` website module.
- `$OPS/domains/noodlestan/main.tf` — module wiring (module `art_md_web`) and outputs.

**Resources:**

- `$OPS/modules/static-website/s3-bucket`
- `$OPS/modules/static-website/cf-distribution`

**Shared:**

- Certificate — `$OPS/domains/noodlestan/certificate/main.tf`, ACM `noodlestan.org` with SAN `*.noodlestan.org` in `us-east-1`. Covers both Art MD Website domains.
- Hosted zone — `$OPS/domains/noodlestan/domain/main.tf`, Route 53 zone `noodlestan.org`.
